description=Interactive WebUI dashboard for AETHER Kernel. Features genuine BORE & MGLRU kernel detection with fail-safe flash, zero-resource background freezer (0% CPU/RAM), Stock Audio Bypass default mode, deep hardware HPF noise cancellation (75Hz/150Hz), and live hardware telemetry.
